{"3126880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beneath The Six", "steam_appid": 3126880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Road Map</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/749da7b5e2b1a8aea948cde841340ca4.avif?t=1772212951\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras_big/749da7b5e2b1a8aea948cde841340ca4.webp?t=1772212951 width=1560 height=3907 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to The Six, a magical world where dice define your identity. You are an adventurer trapped in a timeloop at the mercy of a chaotic, impish DM. Every 24 hours, the dungeon beneath the surface morphs and shifts, revealing new secrets and relics which hold the key to your escape.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath The Six is a roguelike experience featuring a revolving array of daily quests, a brutal Arena mode, and 4-player co-op. Collect sets of dice to forge powerful hybrids of fighters, mages, or rogues. Overcome the DM’s daily whims, trade with friends to complete your collection, and—one day, perhaps—escape The Six.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/eebc1667cba985b3a44d271f8b022534.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/eebc1667cba985b3a44d271f8b022534.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Conquer The Daily Dungeons</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into fresh challenges every 24 hours! Explore new quests, face unique enemies, and uncover hidden loot. Success depends on your adaptability—find the perfect combination of dice and skills tailored to the specific dangers of the day. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/6b2833fbb02470e245dfecf310f2628f.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/6b2833fbb02470e245dfecf310f2628f.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Collect Dice</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 130 unique dice sets to collect, the possibilities for character builds are nearly endless. Every set carries its own stats, weapons, and skills. Mix and match them to craft a fearsome, one-of-a-kind adventurer. Show off your builds, share strategies with friends, or party up to conquer weekly challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/c7deba4c7ac9ed3af736674354ad42be.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1170 height=855 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/c7deba4c7ac9ed3af736674354ad42be.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Complete Daily Quests</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Quest Board is your hub for adventure, giving you agency over your session length and objectives.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety and Choice: Choose from various daily quest types with randomized lengths and goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable Content: Find &quot;Quest Posters&quot; as loot during your runs. Successfully bring them back to the Overworld to add them to your Quest Board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scalable Risk: Tweak the difficulty of your quests to balance the challenge. Higher risks lead to greater rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Challenges &amp; Golden Shards</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily and weekly challenges to earn Golden Shards. Spend your shards at the Dice Shop to unlock new sets and expand your tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/1ff67d92f635fe3ddfa765e3125b0b9f.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/1ff67d92f635fe3ddfa765e3125b0b9f.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unique Character Creator</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a hero unlike any other. In each set of seven, every individual dice provides a specific component—from armor and weapons to unique skills. Swap dice between sets to find the ultimate synergy for your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/a2463a3da51c0c94adaa33a257e8ee0f.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1170 height=855 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/a2463a3da51c0c94adaa33a257e8ee0f.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Player Progression &amp; Accolades</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item unlocking: As you delve deeper, you will discover rare loot that unlocks the potential for new, exotic items to spawn in future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Accolades System: Hit progressive milestones to earn a steady stream of Golden Shards, helping you grow your collection faster.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/018257a1ac5f7a7f55cce4c668605661.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/018257a1ac5f7a7f55cce4c668605661.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive The Daily Arena</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>Test your mettle in our brutal Arena mode. Face waves of increasingly strong enemies with near-impossible intensity. The Arena resets every 24 hours—climb the leaderboard and claim bragging rights over your friends!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/fda85ac56204c4a5f01f5fe28486b6ba.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1170 height=854 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/fda85ac56204c4a5f01f5fe28486b6ba.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Party Up And Explore With Friends</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath The Six supports 4-player co-op. Tackle the dangers of the dungeon with backup, coordinate your builds for maximum impact, and show off your rarest character combinations and appearances.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to The Six, a magical world where dice define your identity. You are an adventurer trapped in a timeloop at the mercy of a chaotic, impish DM. Every 24 hours, the dungeon beneath the surface morphs and shifts, revealing new secrets and relics which hold the key to your escape.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath The Six is a roguelike experience featuring a revolving array of daily quests, a brutal Arena mode, and 4-player co-op. Collect sets of dice to forge powerful hybrids of fighters, mages, or rogues. Overcome the DM’s daily whims, trade with friends to complete your collection, and—one day, perhaps—escape The Six.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/eebc1667cba985b3a44d271f8b022534.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/eebc1667cba985b3a44d271f8b022534.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Conquer The Daily Dungeons</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into fresh challenges every 24 hours! Explore new quests, face unique enemies, and uncover hidden loot. Success depends on your adaptability—find the perfect combination of dice and skills tailored to the specific dangers of the day. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/6b2833fbb02470e245dfecf310f2628f.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/6b2833fbb02470e245dfecf310f2628f.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Collect Dice</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 130 unique dice sets to collect, the possibilities for character builds are nearly endless. Every set carries its own stats, weapons, and skills. Mix and match them to craft a fearsome, one-of-a-kind adventurer. Show off your builds, share strategies with friends, or party up to conquer weekly challenges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/c7deba4c7ac9ed3af736674354ad42be.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1170 height=855 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/c7deba4c7ac9ed3af736674354ad42be.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Complete Daily Quests</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Quest Board is your hub for adventure, giving you agency over your session length and objectives.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety and Choice: Choose from various daily quest types with randomized lengths and goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable Content: Find &quot;Quest Posters&quot; as loot during your runs. Successfully bring them back to the Overworld to add them to your Quest Board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scalable Risk: Tweak the difficulty of your quests to balance the challenge. Higher risks lead to greater rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Challenges &amp; Golden Shards</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily and weekly challenges to earn Golden Shards. Spend your shards at the Dice Shop to unlock new sets and expand your tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/1ff67d92f635fe3ddfa765e3125b0b9f.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/1ff67d92f635fe3ddfa765e3125b0b9f.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unique Character Creator</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge a hero unlike any other. In each set of seven, every individual dice provides a specific component—from armor and weapons to unique skills. Swap dice between sets to find the ultimate synergy for your play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/a2463a3da51c0c94adaa33a257e8ee0f.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1170 height=855 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/a2463a3da51c0c94adaa33a257e8ee0f.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Player Progression &amp; Accolades</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item unlocking: As you delve deeper, you will discover rare loot that unlocks the potential for new, exotic items to spawn in future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Accolades System: Hit progressive milestones to earn a steady stream of Golden Shards, helping you grow your collection faster.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/018257a1ac5f7a7f55cce4c668605661.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1232 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/018257a1ac5f7a7f55cce4c668605661.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive The Daily Arena</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>Test your mettle in our brutal Arena mode. Face waves of increasingly strong enemies with near-impossible intensity. The Arena resets every 24 hours—climb the leaderboard and claim bragging rights over your friends!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/fda85ac56204c4a5f01f5fe28486b6ba.poster.avif?t=1772212951\" width=1170 height=854 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/extras/fda85ac56204c4a5f01f5fe28486b6ba.webm?t=1772212951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Party Up And Explore With Friends</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath The Six supports 4-player co-op. Tackle the dangers of the dungeon with backup, coordinate your builds for maximum impact, and show off your rarest character combinations and appearances.</p>", "short_description": "Forge your hero and dive into the depths of The Six. In this turn-based roguelike, use unique dice sets to build powerful characters. Join forces in 4-player co-op, complete daily quests, and compete for the top spot on the Arena leaderboard.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/ad9ed37d865e6a11b8491d2316a10897db533eb5/header.jpg?t=1772212951", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/7ce96ed96a7b412aac2bdba4adc272dcf8e3061b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772212951", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126880/7ce96ed